Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.75,0:00:07.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Imagine waking up
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.19,0:00:08.31,Main,,0,0,0,,and your AI has
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.31,0:00:09.43,Main,,0,0,0,,already texted you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.43,0:00:10.55,Main,,0,0,0,,That's what Anthropic
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.55,0:00:11.27,Main,,0,0,0,,just launched
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.27,0:00:11.75,Main,,0,0,0,,It's called
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.75,0:00:12.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Claude Duet
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.23,0:00:16.87,Main,,0,0,0,,unpaid
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.87,0:00:18.07,Main,,0,0,0,,which client replied
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.07,0:00:19.03,Main,,0,0,0,,and which meeting
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.03,0:00:19.99,Main,,0,0,0,,needs you today
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.99,0:00:20.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Then you just
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.55,0:00:25.59,Main,,0,0,0,,build me a deck
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.59,0:00:26.63,Main,,0,0,0,,chase this payment
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.63,0:00:27.75,Main,,0,0,0,,And it keeps working
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.75,0:00:29.03,Main,,0,0,0,,while you're away
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.03,0:00:29.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Before it sends
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.15,0:00:33.51,Main,,0,0,0,,asks you first
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.55,0:00:40.15,Main,,0,0,0,,So, honest question
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.15,0:00:41.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Would you let AI
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.11,0:00:42.23,Main,,0,0,0,,handle your inbox?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.23,0:00:44.83,Highlight,,0,0,0,,Yes or no?
